        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pipeline, crude oil, offshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pipeline, crude oil, offshore
Rough estimation based on use of materials and information for construction works by one company. Life time 30 years.;
UUID: 85fe1a46-aaab-367f-b5a3-201eec1cf4d3
Materials, land use, energy use of construction company and dismantling of pipelines.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Construction of pipelines.
Time period: Data for materials published in 1980. Environmental data for construction of pipelines in 2000.
Production volume: There are 30780km of oil pipelines (on- and offshore) used in Europe.
Sampling: Literature and environmental report of a multinational company. 
Extrapolations: From single data to global situation.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_85fe1a46-aaab-367f-b5a3-201eec1cf4d3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
